# Copy this file to `.env` (same folder) and fill in a real value.
# `.env` is gitignored — it never gets committed.
#
# Local dev: `npm run dev` / `npm run dev:server` load this automatically
# (via node's --env-file-if-exists flag in server/package.json).
#
# Deployed (Render): DON'T upload this file. Set the same key in the
# Render dashboard instead — Service → Environment → "Add Environment
# Variable" — so the deployed server reads it from the real process env.

# OpenAI API key — powers the AI "Custom Category / Theme / Topic" options and
# Alphabet Soup's answer checking. Optional: without it those features
# fall back gracefully.
# Create one at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys (starts with "sk-").
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here
